Third-party data notice

The benchmark figures under data are derived from Australian
Taxation Office data, "Small Business Benchmarks", published at
https://data.gov.au/data/dataset/small-business-benchmarks and licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 2.5 Australia
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/au/). The data has been converted
from the published spreadsheet into JSON and turnover band bounds have been made
adjoining; no published ratio has been altered. The Australian Taxation Office
has not endorsed this software.

The labour, rent, motor vehicle and supplementary cost of sales ranges in
data/other-benchmarks-*.json are reproduced from the Australian
Taxation Office's small business benchmark industry pages under the ATO's
copyright notice (https://www.ato.gov.au/about-ato/using-our-website/copyright-notice),
which permits copying and adaptation provided nothing suggests the ATO or the
Commonwealth endorses the user or its products. Published percentages are
converted to ratio bounds, and a single printed figure is stored as equal
bounds, with no wider interval inferred.

